<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Advanced CSS Styling</title>

    <style>
        body {
            background-color: #f2f2f2;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        }

        
        .container {
            width: 400px;

            
            padding: 20px;

            
            margin: 50px auto;

            
            border: 4px solid #333;

            
            background-image: url("https://via.placeholder.com/400");
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;

            /* Box Model Control */
            box-sizing: border-box;

            color: white;
            text-align: center;
        }

        h1 {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            padding-bottom: 10px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid white;
        }

        p {
            padding: 10px;
            border: 2px dashed white;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <div class="container">
        <h1>Advanced CSS</h1>
        <p>
            This page demonstrates Box Model, background image,
            borders, margins, and padding using CSS.
        </p>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
